# Test fixtures are real captures off Jarno's own watch: GPS tracks whose
# start point is his home to within a few metres, twelve nights of sleep
# with heart rate and HRV, and the watch serial. They stay on this machine
# and out of the public repository.
#
# The tests need them, so a clone cannot run the golden-vector suite -
# see tests/README.md for what they are and how to regenerate them.
